          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕರಾವಳಿ — karāvaḷi — \"a coastline; a coast\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕರಾವಳಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಮೀನುಗಾರರ ಹಳ್ಳಿಗಳು ಇವೆ. karāvaḷiyalli mīnugārara haḷḷigaḷu ive. There are fishing villages along the coast."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕರಾವಳಿ (karāvaḷi) ಪ್ರದೇಶ, the coastal region."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕರಾವಳಿ (karāvaḷi) is a Kannada word for a coastline whose origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
