          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹವಳ (havaḷa) is native Dravidian: DEDR 3998 lists Kannada pavaḷa, \"coral\", with the old p- that modern Kannada turns into h-. Sanskrit pravāla, \"coral\", was itself taken from Dravidian, as Turner notes (CDIAL 8794)."
